dently confirm. Old verdict collapsed to a superseded pointer. F4 LOW (stale cost narrative): registry 056 clarifies arm-1's reservation is CONSUMED_CLOSED (historical ACTIVE_RESERVED lines are superseded; effective active $0); summary==recompute unchanged. HOLDS: sealed evaluation / promotion / deployment remain HELD; CS registry empty by design.",
